y weekday from 7 am till 8 am.\", \"line\": 7, \"span\": \"The duty officer walks the north corridor every weekday from 7 am till 8 am\"}, {\"text\": \"The duty officer's round happens right after the shift handover.\", \"line\": 7, \"span\": \"right after the shift handover\"}, {\"text\": \"A second round covers the workshop and the paint store from 13:05 till 16:20 hours on Wednesdays only.\", \"line\": 8, \"span\": \"A second round covers the workshop and the paint store from 13:05 till 16:20 hours on Wednesdays only\"}, {\"text\": \"The site manager has asked for a third round for years.\", \"line\": 8, \"span\": \"The site manager has asked for a third round for years\"}, {\"text\": \"The budget has never allowed a third round.\", \"line\": 8, \"span\": \"the budget has never allowed it\"}, {\"text\": \"Frost swells the timber frames on the older doors.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"Frost swells the timber frames on the older doors\"}, {\"text\": \"Between November and February several of the older doors will not latch unless pulled hard.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"so between November and February several of them will not latch unless pulled hard\"}, {\"text\": \"Once the frames dry out in spring, the same doors close cleanly again.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"Once the frames dry out in spring, the same doors close cleanly again\"}, {\"text\": \"The doors are the responsibility of the site.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"While the doors are the responsibility of the site\"}, {\"text\": \"The certified inspection is carried out by an outside contractor.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"the certified inspection is carried out by an outside contractor\"}, {\"text\": \"The outside contractor attends every March 1st to March 31st.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"who attends every March 1st to March 31st\"}, {\"text\": \"During the March visit the contractor tags each door.\", \"line\": 18, \"span\": \"During that visit the contractor tags each door\"}, {\"text\": \"During the March visit the contractor photographs the closer.\", \"line\": 18, \"span\": \"photographs the closer\"}, {\"text\": \"During the March visit the contractor leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse for the auditors.\", \"line\": 18, \"span\": \"and leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse for the auditors\"}, {\"text\": \"It became custom that whoever finds a defect writes it in the log.\", \"line\": 22, \"span\": \"It became custom that whoever finds a defect writes it in the log\"}, {\"text\": \"Whoever finds a defect pins a yellow card to the door itself.\", \"line\": 22, \"span\": \"and pins a yellow card to the door itself\"}, {\"text\": \"The yellow card stays on the door until the repair is signed off.\", \"line\": 22, \"span\": \"The card stays there until the repair is signed off\"}, {\"text\": \"In most cases the card and the written record are cleared as a tie.\", \"line\": 24, \"span\": \"In most cases it is a tie\"}, {\"text\": \"One officer clears both the card and the written record at the end of the week.\", \"line\": 24, \"span\": \"because one officer clears both at the end of the week\"}]}","ttft_ms":10299,"type":"result","duration_ms":10409,"uuid":"f326f221-aff8-4156-b345-64068bb65a81","ttft_stream_ms":2461,"time_to_request_ms":62,"first_content_frame_ms":2461,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
